<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swords, axes, clubs and bows - and tons of variants for each weapon.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch freely</strong> between swinging your weapons, firing your bow and casting your spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block, dodge, and counter</strong> enemies in real-time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magic Powers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast <strong>fire</strong>, <strong>ice</strong>, <strong>roots</strong>, <strong>lightning</strong>, <strong>poison</strong>, and <strong>wind</strong> using a <strong>gesture-based spell casting system</strong> that you\u00a0 upgrade throughout each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain powers</strong>\u00a0together with weapon combos or effects to gain the upper hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/0b70de4579ec09ec7da9fe06564811a6.poster.avif?t=1770386465\" width=930 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/0b70de4579ec09ec7da9fe06564811a6.webm?t=1770386465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/0b70de4579ec09ec7da9fe06564811a6.mp4?t=1770386465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inventory &amp; Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources, tweak your build, and twist fate to your advantage\u2014or throw it into chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potions</strong>: Restore your health and mana to stay in the fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets</strong>: Equip passive boosts and strange effects that shape your playstyle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And customize your run with modifiers for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage</strong>, <strong>status effects</strong>, and <strong>elemental power</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop rates</strong>, <strong>loot rarity</strong>, and <strong>enemy rewards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mana regen</strong>, <strong>spell behavior</strong>, and <strong>resource costs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy types</strong>, <strong>spawn patterns</strong>, and <strong>world conditions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some upgrades are straightforward while others are unpredictable and risky\u2014<strong>stack them wisely, or embrace the madness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/19701b7b1c4172c292c9fc53266b43e5.poster.avif?t=1770386465\" width=930 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/19701b7b1c4172c292c9fc53266b43e5.webm?t=1770386465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/19701b7b1c4172c292c9fc53266b43e5.mp4?t=1770386465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/420e3916cc87f3e4df043e90d9f6d861.avif?t=1770386465\" width=616 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is not static. Each time you return, it reshapes itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest folds in new directions. Caves open where they weren\u2019t. You may return to the same place\u2014but it will not be the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Between Each Run:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose a starting weapon</strong> to carry with you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip your outfit</strong> and define your look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select an altar offering</strong>, each of which grants <strong>a unique modifier</strong> to your run (some with unfortunate tradeoffs)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover new paths</strong>, side areas, and secrets each time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die, learn, and push further.</strong><br>Every death opens a new branch of the story\u2014and every Crossing is yours alone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/f84c96381256017121cf44a89fcb7908.avif?t=1770386465\" width=616 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sap drips from the trees like blood. The roots twitch like veins. The forest does not sleep. It waits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It remembers what you were.<br>It watches what you become.<br>And somewhere in its hollow chest, something is still beating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not the end. This is between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/91c2e0d35d3fdc33e2b9d58d787158f9.poster.avif?t=1770386465\" width=930 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/91c2e0d35d3fdc33e2b9d58d787158f9.webm?t=1770386465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/extras/91c2e0d35d3fdc33e2b9d58d787158f9.mp4?t=1770386465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Neat Corporation"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782960/1390276b90385c0d4e48efdfe69d1b2b55fe2eb8/header.jpg?t=1770386465","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2782960/117809406/d354f7f4be0c40b99b8b0191b2d2f87d5c8a6536/1770111310/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770371733","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2782960/117809406/d354f7f4be0c40b99b8b0191b2d2f87d5c8a6536/1770111310/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770371733","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2782960/117809406/d354f7f4be0c40b99b8b0191b2d2f87d5c8a6536/1770111310/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770371733","id":257142812,"name":"Crossings Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142812/ed153b0f411e7a47fe37a2aad57a696cf36850ea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770371733"}],"name":"Crossings","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Crossings - $9.99 USD","packageid":994506,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":999}],"title":"Buy Crossings"}],"packages":[994506],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window